22f8e34d3acb1202d0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/def17231/uploads/origins/ea465728-71dc-48af-8c1d-03e68319f7f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=895bfdcdc6a103a68e054884140979d7 3x"}, "body": "Hi Matthew, my name is Tsukiya Kosuke, and I'm a Vtuber.\nMy name is Kosuke Tsukiyo, and I am a Vtuber. I love the bright colors and soft, cheerful expressions of your illustrations! I would love to have an illustration of my own drawn by you, so I would like to make a request.\n\nI would like to make a request for you to draw my own illustration.\nCharacter: Tsukiyo Kousuke (URL of the reference image is attached below)\nCostume: The default white idol-like costume shown in the reference image.\nComposition, pose, etc:\nWe would like an illustration of \"HANSUKE with a big smile on his face, holding out a bouquet of roses to us (in celebration of something).\nOther details of the background and pose are up to the artist.\nAlso, the character has armpit hair (if it is visible in the composition), and if possible, I would like you to draw it (the color of the body hair is black).\n\nFor the following purposes, it would be helpful if the top, left and right sides of the character (hair, arms, etc.) are as unbroken as possible.\n\nWe would like to use it for distribution on Youtube, etc., its thumbnail, and for use on social networking sites, etc. In addition, we would appreciate permission to print the image for personal viewing if possible (we will not distribute or sell the image).\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could provide us with a psd format. It would be greatly appreciated if you could separate the characters, background, signatures, etc. on separate layers if possible.\n\nWe would appreciate it if you could separate the characters, background, signatures, etc. into separate layers as much as possible.\n(1) https://twitter.com/RyosukeTsukiyo (2) https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19_zo9HFwtI_E9Ew6ID3ziu95biPTWZ9d?usp=sharing\n\nWe look forward to working with you!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@MatthewMetamor/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4e7cdf3/uploads/origins/9114089f-a6ba-4b9d-98e6-b22ea7067695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1b439b29c947e3127cc37e957848d2b6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4e7cdf3/uploads/origins/9114089f-a6ba-4b9d-98e6-b22ea7067695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1b439b29c947e3127cc37e957848d2b6, https://si.imgix.net/a4e7cdf3/uploads/origins/9114089f-a6ba-4b9d-98e6-b22ea7067695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=533d629888bae22dcf80c167590df2a4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a4e7cdf3/uploads/origins/9114089f-a6ba-4b9d-98e6-b22ea7067695?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fbb8695465a801970bfd8bc786aebe20 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2700450, "client_id": 300885, "nc": 0}, {"path": "/@MatthewMetamor/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2700450, "client_id": 573144, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/05875072/uploads/origins/4d3c4c87-8267-4cbd-a1fd-f4e30b2ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1c333cdf9fe616c2a119da2027d607f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05875072/uploads/origins/4d3c4c87-8267-4cbd-a1fd-f4e30b2ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1c333cdf9fe616c2a119da2027d607f, https://si.imgix.net/05875072/uploads/origins/4d3c4c87-8267-4cbd-a1fd-f4e30b2ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b832ba11aa2a138c9204c77073302610 2x, https://si.imgix.net/05875072/uploads/origins/4d3c4c87-8267-4cbd-a1fd-f4e30b2ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa47aea19929f9c7dbee96fe2d59f54e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/05875072/uploads/origins/4d3c4c87-8267-4cbd-a1fd-f4e30b2ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0085e369e0a9341fc6fa822a8dd8e161", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05875072/uploads/origins/4d3c4c87-8267-4cbd-a1fd-f4e30b2ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0085e369e0a9341fc6fa822a8dd8e161, https://si.imgix.net/05875072/uploads/origins/4d3c4c87-8267-4cbd-a1fd-f4e30b2ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6e16e525f10aceb0176f5ade966d3ce8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/05875072/uploads/origins/4d3c4c87-8267-4cbd-a1fd-f4e30b2ae96d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7feaee7dbc0eb6baccdf61d7a406b23e 3x"}, "body": "Hi Matthew, nice to meet you.\nI have always loved your FFXIV illustrations. If you don't mind, I would like to have an illustration with my Aura and Estinien.\n\nReference link: https://ibb.co/album/WkVJt8\nAura has straight black hair and purple and blue odd eyes. She has metal ornaments on both horns. She is a very quiet and somewhat shy girl. She is easily embarrassed in front of her lover.\nI would love to have Estinien's hairstyle to be ponytail. \nAura is 160 cm and Estinien is 202 cm. If possible, I would be happy if the composition can express the height difference between them. \n\nYou may choose any of the outfits in the link, or you may dress them in another outfit of your choice. Please feel free to arrange it as you wish.\n\nI will also leave specific poses and facial expressions to you! I would love to see them in a romantic and sweet pose. \n\nThank you very much in advance!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@MatthewMetamor/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2700450, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b5493d46/uploads/origins/9dd23939-4d30-4271-98a7-e7d6acc1926e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12de46090583191604bfcb135ac67cc4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b5493d46/uploads/origins/9dd23939-4d30-4271-98a7-e7d6acc1926e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12de46090583191604bfcb135ac67cc4, https://si.imgix.net/b5493d46/uploads/origins/9dd23939-4d30-4271-98a7-e7d6acc1926e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcdc29d78f5f95e8976cc19c736678a0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b5493d46/uploads/origins/9dd23939-4d30-4271-98a7-e7d6acc1926e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37d02c6c94139da69a438eaa76d1c9ae 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b5493d46/uploads/origins/9dd23939-4d30-4271-98a7-e7d6acc1926e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a81a12f632d77cb103ea461fe33d055", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b5493d46/uploads/origins/9dd23939-4d30-4271-98a7-e7d6acc1926e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a81a12f632d77cb103ea461fe33d055, https://si.imgix.net/b5493d46/uploads/origins/9dd23939-4d30-4271-98a7-e7d6acc1926e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=84ef58dc7f00ebb015ab710dbb592701 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b5493d46/uploads/origins/9dd23939-4d30-4271-98a7-e7d6acc1926e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=507c0a2a0de1d9078b00ecfc37b0a5fa 3x"}, "body": "Hello Matthew!\n\nI really love the way you draw Haurchefant!\nIf it's alright, may I request an illustration of my OC with Haurchefant?\n\nDetails:\n- Please feel free to omit the flower hairpiece and the earring on my OC\n- My OC and Haurchefant are very close, like brothers.\n- I would like a scene of my OC and Haurchefant drinking beer together happily under a starry night sky in Ishgard. It is ok for the background to be simple. I would like to see some snow. Please draw freely for the background!\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://app.box.com/s/ucnh83r2q0phz9fijoczhoq0hch6qjvk", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@MatthewMetamor/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2063edf9/uploads/origins/31740a44-0633-468d-84c2-0ef4ae2f02ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=694225d7c135dcd95b0561d73fa80e3b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2063edf9/uploads/origins/31740a44-0633-468d-84c2-0ef4ae2f02ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=694225d7c135dcd95b0561d73fa80e3b, https://si.imgix.net/2063edf9/uploads/origins/31740a44-0633-468d-84c2-0ef4ae2f02ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7e5b219786dc094431ff5b7219a0d25f 2x, https