&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0ab6a2d2a52d5ae01bdbd905871635f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ef258f39/uploads/origins/d340df32-3965-4a09-b731-6db09e168f52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4fa0fbe964935e6815c7e8dec9b6b529 3x"}, "body": "Dear Matthew, it is nice to meet you.\nI was attracted by your attractive coloring and design in the newest issue, and I would like to request an illustration from you.\n\nI would be very happy to see your illustration of the two men in the material.\nThe composition, situation, and scope of the drawing are all up to you.\nThe dark-haired man looks like a big dog and the silver-haired man looks like its owner.\n\n\u2727 Materials\nhttps://tree-ragdoll-4fa.notion.site/commission-ea5b2bc564134acabd929acc2212418a\nAs long as the general atmosphere is maintained, hair and clothing are optional.\nYou may also change or omit minor accessories, tattoos, and other decorations.\n\nWe look forward to working with you.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@MatthewMetamor/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2700450, "client_id": 523300, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1b1b1aa0/uploads/origins/7aa71e84-a679-4c3a-9076-7a492bdef46f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2a2ed3dc5eca80f5ee1672e8f3f8661", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1b1b1aa0/uploads/origins/7aa71e84-a679-4c3a-9076-7a492bdef46f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2a2ed3dc5eca80f5ee1672e8f3f8661, https://si.imgix.net/1b1b1aa0/uploads/origins/7aa71e84-a679-4c3a-9076-7a492bdef46f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=495b07ad470574fe5427b57b4967c0fe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1b1b1aa0/uploads/origi